  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375\b6c (190\u000e5f).",
    "Line a baking dish with parchment paper.",
    "Place the sliced potatoes in the baking dish and drizzle with 1 tablespoon of olive oil, sprinkle with salt and pepper, and toss to coat.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix together lemon juice, minced garlic, and dried oregano.",
    "Place the hake fillets on top of the potatoes, brush with the remaining 1 tablespoon of olive oil, and sprinkle with salt and pepper.",
    "Pour the lemon-garlic mixture over the hake fillets.",
    "Top with crumbled feta cheese.",
    "Bake for 20 minutes, then remove from the oven and sprinkle with chopped parsley.",
    "Return to the oven and bake for an additional 5-7 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly."
  ],
